{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSString"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"configurationURL:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSURL"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"configurationURL"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"identifier","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A string that uniquely identifies the source in the style to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which it is added."}]}]},{"name":"configurationURL","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A URL to a TileJSON configuration file describing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source’s contents and other metadata."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An initialized raster tile source."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or canonical URL. The URL should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a Mapbox URL is specified, this source uses a tile size of 256. For all"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other tilesets, the default value is 512. (See the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" documentation for more information about tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sizes.) If you need to use a tile size other than the default, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:tileSize:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNRasterTileSource(im)initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","title":"MLNStyle","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle","abstract":[{"text":"The proxy object for the current map style.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNRasterTileSource"}],"abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies raster image tiles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A raster tile source is added to an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. Use a raster style layer to control the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"appearance of content supplied by the raster tile source."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource","title":"MLNRasterTileSource","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterStyleLayer":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is a style layer that renders georeferenced raster","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"imagery on the map, especially raster tiles.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterStyleLayer","title":"MLNRasterStyleLayer","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrasterstylelayer","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNRasterStyleLayer"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNStyle/addSource:":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnstyle\/addsource:","role":"symbol","title":"addSource:","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Adds a new source to the current style.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addSource:"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNRasterTileSource/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier and configuration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"URL.","type":"text"}],"title":"initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNRasterTileSource\/initWithIdentifier:configurationURL:","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnrastertilesource\/initwithidentifier:configurationurl:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"code":"NSNumber","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a floating-point number that specifies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"width and height (measured in points) at which the map displays each raster"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"image tile when the map’s zoom level is an integer. The raster tile source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scales its images up or down when the map’s zoom level falls between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"integers."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","title":"MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntilesourceoptiontilesize"}}}